r's Guide)</i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 24. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-NW-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-NW_11-0\">11.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-NW_11-1\">11.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cryptic_Studios\" title=\"wikipedia:Cryptic Studios\">Cryptic Studios</a> (December 2013). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Neverwinter:_Shadowmantle\" title=\"Neverwinter: Shadowmantle\">Neverwinter: Shadowmantle</a></i>. <a class=\"extiw\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfect_World_Entertainment\" title=\"wikipedia:Perfect World Entertainment\">Perfect World Entertainment</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-tVR-p5-12\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-tVR-p5_12-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jim_Butler\" title=\"Jim Butler\">Jim Butler</a> (1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Vilhon_Reach_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Vilhon Reach (sourcebook)\">The Vilhon Reach</a> (Player's Guide)</i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 5. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0400-3\">0-7869-0400-3</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-EdTweet-13\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-EdTweet_13-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20200224175103/https://twitter.com/TheEdVerse/status/1231995991613673472\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">TheEdVerse on Twitter</a>. (27-12-2021). Retrieved on 27-12-2021.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260514031049\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: fals